  phrases:
  - "Welcome to Slothy\u2019s Bakery"
  - "My name is Slothy, and I\u2019m the baker."
  - "Thank you for choosing Slothy\u2019s Bakery to start working."
  - Today I need your help with comparing pieces of cakes or desserts.
  - So I would like to explain a little about the magic of comparing fractions.
  - You can compare two fractions by checking their numerators and denominators.
  - With this, you can determine which fraction is greater than, less than or equals
    to another, regardless of whether their denominators or numerators are equals.
  - For this task, you need to analyze the denominator of the fractions to determine
    if they are comparable.
  - I will give you an example.
